4-22C24-57 48-82 83-82C118-82 143-57 143-22M583-82C618-82 643-57 643-22C643 12 618 38 584 38C549 38 524 13 524-22C524-57 548-82 583-82Z\"></path></defs></svg>","mathFallback":false,"description":"JEE Main's 2020 JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot Paper's All Questions with solutions provider ExamSIDE.Com","paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot","nextq":"Txt0uLrhcklmhRd7XJjgy2xukf3hktvy","prevq":"nqkaiGqDNT3OGTCydCjgy2xukf3mvk55","questions":[{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"inorganic-chemistry","chapter":"d-and-f-block-elements","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"easy","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-03 15:00","question":{"en":{"content":"The incorrect statement is :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"In manganate and permanganate ions, the p-bonding takes place by overlap of p-orbitals\nof oxygen and d-orbitals of manganese"},{"identifier":"B","content":"Manganate ion is green in colour and\npermanganate ion in purple in colour"},{"identifier":"C","content":"Manganate and permanganate ions are\nparamagnetic"},{"identifier":"D","content":"Manganate and permanganate ions are\ntetrahedral"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>To identify the incorrect statement, let's analyze each option :</p>\n<p>Option A : \"In manganate and permanganate ions, the π-bonding takes place by overlap of p-orbitals of oxygen and d-orbitals of manganese.\" \nThis statement is true. In both manganate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.646ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.694ex\" height=\"2.687ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -902 3400.7 1187.6\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1651,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(2447,431.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2447,-285.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> and permanganate <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.646ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"6.894ex\" height=\"2.554ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -843.3 3047.1 1128.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msubsup\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1651,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D442\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D442\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2447,431.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(2447,-285.6) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> ions, the manganese atom is in a high oxidation state (+6 and +7, respectively) and forms bonds with oxygen atoms involving the overlap of p-orbitals of oxygen and d-orbitals of manganese.</p>\n<p>Option B : \"Manganate ion is green in colour and permanganate ion in purple in colour.\"\nThis statement is true. Manganate ions are indeed green and permanganate ions are purple in aqueous solution.</p>\n<p>Option C : \"Manganate and permanganate ions are paramagnetic.\"\nThis statement is incorrect. Both manganate and permanganate ions are diamagnetic, not paramagnetic. In these ions, manganese is in +6 and +7 oxidation states, respectively, and has no unpaired electrons.</p>\nManganate(<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.735ex\" height=\"3.314ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1453.9 1651 1464.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(373.7,883) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>O<sub>4</sub>\n<sup>2–</sup>)\n,\n<br><br>Mn(25) = [Ar]3d<sup>6</sup>4s<sup>2</sup>\n<br><br>Mn<sup>+6</sup>(25) = [Ar]3d<sup>1</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Paramagnetic\n<br><br>Permanganate (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"3.735ex\" height=\"3.33ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1461 1651 1472\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mover\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"OP\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1051,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D45B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D45B\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(373.7,883) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2B\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2B\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"37\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-37\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>O<sub>4</sub><sup>-</sup>)\n<br><br>Mn(25) = [Ar]3d<sup>6</sup>4s<sup>2</sup>\n<br><br>Mn<sup>+7</sup>(25) = [Ar]3d<sup>0</sup> <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.025ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.262ex\" height=\"1.181ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -511 1000 522\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2192\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2192\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> Diamagnetic\n<p>Option D : \"Manganate and permanganate ions are tetrahedral.\"\nThis statement is true. Both manganate and permanganate ions have a tetrahedral geometry, with the manganese atom at the center and the four oxygen atoms surrounding it.</p>\n<p>Therefore, the incorrect statement is option C.</p>"},"hi":{"content":"असत्य कथन है :","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":"मैंगनेट और परमैंगनेट आयनों में, p-बंधन ऑक्सीजन के p-ऑर्बिटल्स और मैंगनीज के d-ऑर्बिटल्स के ओवरलेप से होता है"},{"identifier":"B","content":"मैंगनेट आयन हरे रंग का और परमैंगनेट आयन बैंगनी रंग का होता है"},{"identifier":"C","content":"मैंगनेट और परमैंगनेट आयन पैरामैग्नेटिक होते हैं"},{"identifier":"D","content":"मैंगनेट और परमैंगनेट आयन टेट्राहेड्रल होते हैं"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":null,"comprehension":null,"direction":null}},"question_id":"gafN2KKWlOo1S7JqAljgy2xukf3lsk6i","updated_time":1605513526,"permalink":"the-incorrect-statement-is--jee-main-chemistry-chemical-bonding-and-molecular-structure-lcye5qwxyaenzwb3","paperId":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","topic":"important-compounds-of-transition-elements","isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["odd_one_out"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2020-online-3rd-september-evening-slot","active":true},{"country":"in","examGroup":"jee","exam":"jee-main","subjectGroup":null,"subject":"chemistry","chapterGroup":"organic-chemistry","chapter":"aldehydes-ketones-and-carboxylic-acids","year":2020,"paperTitle":"JEE Main 2020 (Online) 3rd September Evening Slot","timeAllotted":144000,"marks":4,"negMarks":1,"languages":["en"],"difficulty":"easy","topicName":null,"type":"mcq","examDate":"2020-09-03 15:00","question":{"en":{"content":"The increasing order of 